<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="TS_Category_Excel_files">TS_Category Excel files</span></h2>
<p>Each entry in TS_Category has an associated xls file with worksheets for each rank of monster or placeable in that category. For example, for the prefix TS_Darkspawn there are worksheets named:
</p>
<ul><li>TS_DarkspawnCreCritter</li>
<li>TS_DarkspawnCreNormal</li>
<li>TS_DarkspawnCreLieutenant</li>
<li>TS_DarkspawnCreBoss</li>
<li>TS_DarkspawnCreEliteBoss</li>
<li>TS_DarkspawnPlcCritter</li>
<li>TS_DarkspawnPlcNormal</li>
<li>TS_DarkspawnPlcLieutenant</li>
<li>TS_DarkspawnPlcBoss</li>
<li>TS_DarkspawnPlcEliteBoss</li></ul>
<p>Each worksheet has the folowing columns:
</p>
<table class="wikitable">

<tr>
<th> Column </th>
<th> Type </th>
<th> Description
</th></tr>
<tr>
