</td>
<td> A number that uniquely identifies the entry (unless creating an <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="M2DA override">M2DA override</a>). ID numbers are listed from smallest to highest within a given file but do not need to be consecutive.
</td></tr>
